    "detailed_description": "'N3Rally' is a rally driving game brought to you by a rally enthusiast from Japan. Conquer courses with a variety of surfaces including tarmac, gravel, ice, snow, and sand, across diverse landscapes and in all weather conditions, from sunny days to rainy ones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete in Online Rankings</h2>Aim for the top spot in the rankings with your favorite car!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Courses</h2>Explore over 8 courses and 40 stages featuring various landscapes and surfaces, from tarmac-focused tracks to gravel and snowy roads. Enjoy driving on different surfaces and at various times of the day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 40 Cars</h2>Choose from a wide range of cars, from production models to rally cars. Find your favorite car and enjoy customizing it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally</h2>Experience rally events and single stages within the game. You can also race against rally cars in the same class.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle for the Top</h2>Compete with players worldwide through cross-platform online rankings. Each stage has its own leaderboard. Strive for the fastest times and make your mark on the leaderboards.",
    "about_the_game": "'N3Rally' is a rally driving game brought to you by a rally enthusiast from Japan. Conquer courses with a variety of surfaces including tarmac, gravel, ice, snow, and sand, across diverse landscapes and in all weather conditions, from sunny days to rainy ones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete in Online Rankings</h2>Aim for the top spot in the rankings with your favorite car!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Courses</h2>Explore over 8 courses and 40 stages featuring various landscapes and surfaces, from tarmac-focused tracks to gravel and snowy roads. Enjoy driving on different surfaces and at various times of the day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 40 Cars</h2>Choose from a wide range of cars, from production models to rally cars. Find your favorite car and enjoy customizing it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally</h2>Experience rally events and single stages within the game. You can also race against rally cars in the same class.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle for the Top</h2>Compete with players worldwide through cross-platform online rankings. Each stage has its own leaderboard. Strive for the fastest times and make your mark on the leaderboards.",
    "short_description": "'N3Rally' combines a charming aesthetic with intense racing action. Drive a range of vehicles, from production cars to rally cars, and master various terrains such as tarmac, gravel, and snow!",
